I'm not quite sure what BW is referring to, since the PYEC isn't the
Valkyrie quest artifact.

However, Boudewijn is correct, you cannot wish for your OWN quest artifact,
so, as a Valkyrie, you CANNOT wish for the Orb of Fate.  You can wish for
OTHER classes artifacts, but you will get blasted by them (since you aren't
the right class) and you can only pick them up if you are of the right
alignment.  IN ADDITION, you aren't guaranteed to get an artifact (of any
sort) from a wish if some number of artifacts already exist (IIRC, you can
wish for an artifact with 0 or 1 in the game, and always get it, after that,
it's only a chance).

So, as a neutral Valkyrie, you could wish for the PYEC and keep it, but
there's a good chance that you won't get it if a few artifacts already exist
in your game.

The Wallet is unaligned, so it will not blast you, but, it is an artifact,
so you still have a chance of not getting it when you wish for it if a
couple other artifacts already exist.



